WEBVTT

00:13:58.716 --> 00:14:02.593
in na druge, najbolj pomembne načine,

00:14:02.593 --> 00:14:05.187
je to ekipa, 
in če mislite, da sem jaz huda,

00:14:05.187 --> 00:14:06.651
boste hoteli spoznati Bonnie.

00:14:06.651 --> 00:14:08.026
(Smeh)

00:14:08.026 --> 00:14:10.541
Bonnie, kje si?

00:14:10.541 --> 00:14:13.164
Kje si?

00:14:13.164 --> 00:14:16.954
To je Bonnie Stoll. (Aplavz)

00:14:16.954 --> 00:14:19.276
Moja kolegica.

00:14:21.072 --> 00:14:23.541
Kot pravi citat Henry David Thoreauja,

00:14:23.541 --> 00:14:26.575
ko dosežeš svoje sanje,
ne gre toliko za to, kaj dobiš,

00:14:26.575 --> 00:14:29.501
kot za to, kdo s tem postaneš.

00:14:29.501 --> 00:14:31.639
In ja, sedaj stojim pred vami.